\section{Conclusion}

In this report, we presented a function that calculates the average and median yield of a given crop for a specified set of years. We also showed how the function can be modified to calculate the yields for two crops and to include a minimum year requirement. This function can be a valuable tool for farmers and researchers in the field of agriculture.

