The algorithm used in this HTML page is the dynamic programming solution to the subset sum problem. It optimizes the arrangement of numbers, resulting in faster and more accurate calculations. The time complexity of this algorithm is O(n * target), where n is the number of input numbers and target is the sum of all input numbers divided by 2.
