answer:
To generate a seismic signal with multiple frequencies, we can use the superposition principle by adding two or more sine waves with different frequencies. To apply a high-pass filter, we can use the same filter function with a different set of filter coefficients that correspond to a high-pass filter. Finally, we can modify the plot to display both the original and filtered signals side by side using the subplot function.

